`sysmon` EventCode=3 Image="*\\rundll32.exe" Initiated=true
    (DestinationPort=80 OR DestinationPort=443 OR DestinationPort=8080 OR DestinationPort=8443)
| stats count min(_time) as first_seen max(_time) as last_seen values(DestinationIp) as dest_ips values(DestinationPort) as dest_ports by ComputerName, Image
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)

```
Rundll32 Outbound HTTP Connection
Author: fungiknight (Gabriel Lopez)
MITRE: T1071.001 (Application Layer Protocol: Web)

Rundll32 should rarely make outbound HTTP connections.
Emotet uses rundll32 to load its DLL payload, which then
beacons to hardcoded C2 IPs over HTTP.
```
